e":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう\n上半期が終わります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/01/0143262/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上半期を振り返ろうかと思ったけど\n真っ先に『じょしらく』が思い浮かんだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/01/0143262/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか\nなんかまだ\n気持ちが『じょしらく』から抜け出せてない感じ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しくて、素敵な経験をさせてもらえたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切り替えて\n次のステップに向けて\nいろいろ頑張らなきゃいけないんだよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れるとかじゃなくて\nこの経験を糧にして！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下半期もがんばる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/01/0143262/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、今日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BUBKA発売日でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々のソログラビアです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/01/0143262/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと嬉しい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくださいましたでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんていうんですかね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肌の質感がわかる感じの写真で\nなんかすごいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか中田に触れそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りあったら教えて下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/01/0143262/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/01/0143262/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショット。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-36647":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"アップトゥボーイvol.251\n発売されました！！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/25/7311222/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"巻頭グラビア！！！！！！ワア！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい（ ｉ _ ｉ ）\n二千十七年の目標の一つ「グラビア！！」\n年始すぐに叶ったよ（ ｉ _ ｉ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またすぐグラビアやりたいよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アップトゥボーイみてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん川後のグラビアよかった！またみたい！って書いてチェキでも応募してください。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかは\nアップトゥボーイ表紙目標"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/25/7311222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/25/7311222/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTBからアップトゥボーイに\n表記が変わった大事な号だよっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野と奈々未と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/25/7311222/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/25/7311222/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、先日握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/25/7311222/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めまして！\nブログが好きできました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って人が多くて感激（ ｉ _ ｉ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいな～\nだいぶ重めの私のブログが好きなんて\n物好きですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に嬉しかったのが\n「～～っていうとこが好きで、いつもそれを心に頑張ってます」とか\n「～～ってとこ泣けました」とか\n「～～が共感しました」とか\n「文好きで手帳に書いてます」とか\n「考え方に救われました」とか。（ ｉ _ ｉ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか私の日々の暮らしで得たものが\n誰かを救ってるのね。嬉しい（ ｉ _ ｉ ）\nそういう日々をつらつらと書き綴っている意味がここにあって嬉しいナア（ ｉ _ ｉ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文をこえて\nこうやって愛にきてくれて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n今日の服は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大森靖子さんの\n意識高いT！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/25/7311222/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グッズのクオリティの高さよ！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいいい！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入り。\n中は、ROJITAのブラウスです。\n金の襟チラ見せしてます。真夏に昔貰った！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/25/7311222/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/25/7311222/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにスーパーで\nハリハリ漬けを見つけてかいました。\n実家だとおばあちゃんが作ってて好き。\nあと黒豆の納豆と大粒の納豆を買った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらず渋いものが好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"納豆の食べ比べチャレンジとかしたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}}